'''Garland Anthony Hawkins''' (born February 19, 1970) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[defensive end]] for one season with the [[Chicago Bears]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] for the [[Syracuse Orange football|Syracuse Orange]].
